{"4053000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Redhelm Dynasty", "steam_appid": 4053000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053000/extras/7f156c62ec0f62912e1dc8b0d9a9341d.avif?t=1761269598\" width=1150 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redhelm Dynasty is a classic action-adventure platformer with hand drawn graphics and is based upon a 16th-century conflict between the Safavid Empire and the Ottoman Empire. Amidst platforming challenges, you have to learn to utilize your Weapon Arts, which all have different balances of damage, healing, and mana consumption, in order to succeed in your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053000/extras/4b6063bec0073ff0e21ff24d28c000f7.avif?t=1761269598\" width=1150 height=480 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the Safavid king, Ismail the Redhelm, and journey towards the Ottoman capital on a quest for redemption. During your travels you will go through many of the famous historical landmarks of both empires, where you have to face the domineering Ottoman forces, who in this alternate reality have truly lived up to their reputation of being &quot;technologically superior&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five chapters</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn 2D graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat focused on offensive healing </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of short-range and long-range Weapon Arts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ explorable historical landmarks </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ unique enemies and bosses </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053000/extras/7f156c62ec0f62912e1dc8b0d9a9341d.avif?t=1761269598\" width=1150 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redhelm Dynasty is a classic action-adventure platformer with hand drawn graphics and is based upon a 16th-century conflict between the Safavid Empire and the Ottoman Empire. Amidst platforming challenges, you have to learn to utilize your Weapon Arts, which all have different balances of damage, healing, and mana consumption, in order to succeed in your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053000/extras/4b6063bec0073ff0e21ff24d28c000f7.avif?t=1761269598\" width=1150 height=480 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the Safavid king, Ismail the Redhelm, and journey towards the Ottoman capital on a quest for redemption. During your travels you will go through many of the famous historical landmarks of both empires, where you have to face the domineering Ottoman forces, who in this alternate reality have truly lived up to their reputation of being &quot;technologically superior&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five chapters</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn 2D graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat focused on offensive healing </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\